is designed to act without asking for approval first. It will misread signals.
Vision models misjudge price levels on chart screenshots, especially unlabelled
ones. Signals arrive late, execution slips, and the price you get will differ from
the price a channel posted.

Nothing here is investment advice. Losses are yours, including losses caused by a
defect in this software, and including losses that occur while you are not
watching. Run it on a demo account first, leave it disarmed until you have read
enough of the model's reasoning to trust it, and never point it at money you
cannot afford to lose.

